he could piss me off.

00:00:04.386 --> 00:00:06.279
- No, no, no, no, that's not true at all.

00:00:06.279 --> 00:00:10.841
(blues rock instrumental music)

00:00:10.841 --> 00:00:14.279
- People used to think we
were twins because, no.

00:00:14.279 --> 00:00:15.313
Get outta here.

00:00:15.313 --> 00:00:17.961
- Jennifer had all these
idiosyncratic like,

00:00:17.961 --> 00:00:19.795
