00:00:31.398 --> 00:00:33.534
(guitar chord sustained)

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:34.322
- I was at school.

00:00:34.322 --> 00:00:36.273
Instead of going to class,
two of my friends were like,

00:00:36.273 --> 00:00:38.038
let's go to Morongo, this Indian casino.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:42.077
Me and my friend called the
school as each other's dads

00:00:42.077 --> 00:00:43.837
