00:00:43.837 --> 00:00:45.811
So we go, I go with
eight bucks in my pocket

00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:47.413
and just dreams, and I come back.

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:49.364
I make $88 dollars, 11 times.

00:00:49.364 --> 00:00:50.801
I earned it, which is awesome.

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:54.002
- So my mom texts me and asked
if my brother was in school,

00:00:54.002 --> 00:00:56.603
and my friends were like,
"Oh, he went to Morongo".

00:00:56.603 --> 00:00:59.227
And I was like, "No Mom,
he went to the casino,

00:00:59.227 --> 00:01:02.059
where you can't play because he's not 18".

00:01:02.059 --> 00:01:03.661
- And all of a sudden your
Mom calls and you're like,

00:01:03.661 --> 00:01:04.984
"It's cool guys, I got this."

00:01:04.984 --> 00:01:07.118
And I'm like thinking,
telling my mom that,

00:01:07.118 --> 00:01:08.723
"Oh yeah, I'm at, I'm at school right now"

00:01:08.723 --> 00:01:11.219
