00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:14.190
Devastation.

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:16.304
She did me wrong, and I
wasn't gonna let it go by.

00:01:16.304 --> 00:01:20.377
It was a lot of me, giving
Sarah the silent treatment.

00:01:20.377 --> 00:01:23.163
- This was like our longest fight.

00:01:23.163 --> 00:01:24.570
At first, I'm like, I don't care,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:27.890
