try to rub it in my face.

00:01:27.890 --> 00:01:31.419
Finally, my mom knew that
I was the better child,

00:01:31.419 --> 00:01:34.113
that I am the good girl
that God has given them,

00:01:34.113 --> 00:01:37.548
and he is you know, what he is.

00:01:37.548 --> 00:01:39.453
- Early high school, I
was sitting on my bed,

00:01:39.453 --> 00:01:40.938
I had our dog Cindy,

00:01:40.938 --> 00:01:42.749
she was you know, cute little dog,

00:01:42.749 --> 00:01:44.375
